    "answer": {
      "short": "$9$ or $-9$.",
      "worked": "Let the number be $x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2-15&=66\\\\x^2&=81\\\\x&=\\pm\\sqrt{81}\\\\x&=\\pm9\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe possible numbers are $9$ and $-9$.",
